Update 3 (v1.2.0)

Added alternative tracking mode that monitors pistol interactions to track ammo.
This mode is enabled automatically when ammo can't be determined or when a recognized incompatible addon is enabled.

Update 2 (v1.1.0)

Updated to AlyxLib v2.0.0
Fixed incorrect ammo count being stored sometimes
Fixed left handed ammo being incorrect
Added print_bullets_in_gun_clip console command for testing

